## Learning philosophy

We will **not** rush through all five projects.

For each project:

```text
Explain
   ↓
Demonstrate
   ↓
You implement
   ↓
You encounter/debug failures
   ↓
Code review
   ↓
Extend the solution
   ↓
Explain the concept yourself
```

And importantly, **Project 4 and Project 5 will intentionally reduce the amount of hand-holding**. That's where we'll find out whether you've actually internalized GX.

